It's been a while since anybody asked this.  It usually pops up at least once
a week.

Anyway, the answer is that users that want to su to root must be in the group
"system".  You can specify this when setting up a user with adduser (or the new
account manager in V4.0 - coming soon) or by directly editing the /etc/group
file.

