edit the kernel configuration file /usr/sys/conf/<HOSTNAME>

add the following line at the end of options lines:
options CDFS

perform doconfig

(man doconfig)

cp /vmunix /vmunix.old
mv /sys/<HOSTNAME>/vmunix /vmunix

then reboot your system

