>	I am getting a UBC (write error) whenever i try to write to a SGI
>drive NFS mounted on our DECs.

Two possibilities.  One is a diagnostic added in UBC code that is triggered
by NFS.  I forget the details and the release it's in, but you didn't
offer the releases you're running.  Grumble.  Or mount command output.
Or nfsstat output.

The other is if you're running Irix 5.3, we mounted the file system with
NFS V3.  Unless you have all the patches from SGI, don't expect much
from it.  A workaround is to mount using NFS V2 (-o vers=2).
