Starting with V3.2, Digital UNIX (DEC OSF/1) shipped with a single user
Networker license.  The subset itself is part of the base kit CD.  I highly
recommend this.  It does automatic unattended backups  and online restores.
It is the full single local client Legato Networker with a Digital logo...

Get the subset off the CD, find the manuals on the doc CD and go for it.  For
the most part, it works out of the box.  I run the fileserver for our office
on an Alphastation 200 4/166 with a Tz15 (8mm 5GB) tape.  I put a tape in once
a week and look at the status emails I get every morning.

I also recommend Adv FS for all filesystems if you don't already have that up.
You can at least do single volume domains with the base license.  No fsck is
worth it!  I also have the AdvFS utilities PAK so I can do multi-volume domains
and fileset management.

Jim



