>Hello
>
>I have an Ethernet network with an alpha station, an HP LaserJet
>printer, a PC.
>
>I want to mount the printer on the PC to be used by software like
>Windows, through my station, but I don't know how to customize my
>station to do it...

Two solutions:
    1. Attach the printer on your PC; install a lpd daemon on the
       PC, configure the Alpha box to talk to the lpd daemon.
    2. Attach the printer to your Alpha box; install samba and
       make the printer shareable.

The 2nd solution is preferred since the UNIX box can stay up longer,
and handle multitasking better.
