These are only guesses, but you need to:
tar xf tar-file

That done, if it doesn't work, the tar file is corrupt. 

Did you download in binary mode? (This is a very common error!)

Was it a compressed tar, in which case you must uncompress or gunzip
first. (Compressed files normally end in ".Z". gziped file with
".gz".)

