: Solaris.  I spoke to technical support there and they said they couldn't help
: me unless DEC provided support for it, and I haven't been able to find any
: from DEC.

  The only generic support is in the form of lpd which the JetDirect card
  will handle.  If OSF/1 knows how to print to a remote lpd computer, it 
