: resource under osf/1 3.2 via samba suite) has those 4 lines on a separate
: piece of paper ;(.
: I beleive this is LaserJet 4M printer feature, but how to turn it off ?

  Nope, this is called a burst page and is generated by the JetDirect card
  itself.  Foe early models of the JetDirect card, there was no way to turn
  it off except by using lpd -h, but the newer cards have an option which
  you can set via tftp downloading, or by simply telnetting to the JetDirect
  card and turning it off.  Older cards can be upgraded through a download
  program that runs on PCs with Novell or vi HP-UX.  Visit ftp.hp.com and
  the /pub/networking directory.


