 System V Compatibility

 Digital UNIX enhances System V compatibility by means of a habitat mech-
 anism. In those few cases where a given command or interface may be-
 have differently under OSF/1, SVID 2, or SVID 3, the habitat mecha-
 nism permits the user to specify which behavior is preferred.

 System V Release 3.2 (SVR3)

