 Filter (BPF), which provides more flexible and efficient filtering.
 (BPF was developed by the University of California, Lawrence Berke-
 ley Laboratory.)

 Several public domain applications that use the Packetfilter are in-
 tegrated in Digital UNIX including rarpd, tcpdump, tcpslice, nfswatch,
 and nfslogsum.

