 ing, mirroring, and a graphical user interface that allows data stor-
 age management functions to be performed online, without disrupting
 users or applications. (SPD 51.24.xx)

 DECsafe Available Server significantly reduces downtime due to sys-
 tem hardware or software failures. It provides multihost access to SCSI
 disks and a generic failover mechanism for network-based services and
 applications. (SPD 44.17.xx)

 The POLYCENTER Advanced File System Utilities extend the high avail-
 ability and flexibility of AdvFS. The AdvFS Utilities provide a Graph-
 ical User Interface (GUI) to ease management tasks, and online util-
 ities to dynamically resize file systems, defragment files, balance
 percentage of space used on volumes, undelete files using trashcans,
 stripe files, and clone files for hot backup. (SPD 44.52.xx)

